    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "sin or hans",
     "texto": [
      "**sin/sit/sine** = **his/her own** (when the owner is the subject: he or she).\n\n- Jørgen arbejder i **sin** have. → his own garden\n- Jørgen arbejder i **hans** have. → someone else's garden (e.g. his father's)\n\nIn the plural there's no confusion: Pamela og Jørgen elsker **deres** børn."
     ],
     "tutora": "pensando"
    },
